      <activity id="de93fced-18e7-5b8d-a04f-36187e2d10a7" activityNameId="9a7e8e07-b013-5f98-94df-484f02755c45" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Light fuel oil, burned in industrial furnace 1MW, non-modulating</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Light fuel oil, burned in industrial furnace 1MW, non-modulating
Inventory for the operation of an oil boiler, data related to fuel input. NOx and CO emissions derived from measurements conducted (ERZ Zurich).  5*000 hours of usage estimated per year.;
UUID: 5f606dc3-b3f6-3e16-89cf-bb583dc2bf9c
Direct air emissions from combustion, including infrastructure, fuel consumption, waste and auxiliary electricity use.
Location: Assumption for operation in Switzerland.
Technology: Average non-modulating, non-condensing furnace used in 2016.
Time period: New data for regulated emissions like NOx, particles, other figures are partly based on older literature data.
Production volume: na
Sampling: Data published in literature based on measurements. 
Extrapolations: Some information from other European countries has been used to determine the emission factors.
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_5f606dc3-b3f6-3e16-89cf-bb583dc2bf9c.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
